{"id":"d576ea6347595034","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-yao-xor-lemma.md","title":"XOR Hardness Amplification","display":"thm-yao-xor-lemma — XOR Hardness Amplification","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-yao-xor-lemma","aliases":["28-thm-yao-xor-lemma"],"type":"theorem","display":"thm-yao-xor-lemma — XOR Hardness Amplification","depends_on":["[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 19.2; §§19.1.1–19.1.2","source_printed_pages":"375–379","source_pdf_pages":"401–405","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-yao-xor-lemma"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-yao-xor-lemma</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-yao-xor-lemma — XOR Hardness Amplification"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4265af5de6457d74\" href=\"?note=4265af5de6457d74\" title=\"28-df-circuit-hardness\">28-df-circuit-hardness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Theorem 19.2; §§19.1.1–19.1.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"375–379"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"401–405"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\delta\\in(0,1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in(0,1/2]\">\\(\\epsilon\\in(0,1/2]\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon&gt;2(1-\\delta)^k\">\\(\\epsilon&gt;2(1-\\delta)^k\\)</span>；硬度和电路模型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4265af5de6457d74\" href=\"?note=4265af5de6457d74\" title=\"28-df-circuit-hardness\">28-df-circuit-hardness</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^{nk}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^{nk}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的块的有序拼接作规范识别；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bmod 2\">\\(\\bmod 2\\)</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 中的余数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^{\\oplus k}:\\{0,1\\}^{nk}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad f^{\\oplus k}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^k f(x_i)\\right)\\bmod 2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^{\\oplus k}:\\{0,1\\}^{nk}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad f^{\\oplus k}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^k f(x_i)\\right)\\bmod 2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H^{1/2+\\epsilon}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f^{\\oplus k})\\ge\\max\\left\\{0,\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{400n}H^{1-\\delta}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\right\\rfloor-3nk-3\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H^{1/2+\\epsilon}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f^{\\oplus k})\\ge\\max\\left\\{0,\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{400n}H^{1-\\delta}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\right\\rfloor-3nk-3\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 19.2（印刷375页/PDF401页）在其原始电路模型中的右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon^2 H^{1-\\delta}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)/(400n)\">\\(\\epsilon^2 H^{1-\\delta}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)/(400n)\\)</span>。本节点给出适用于本目录含常量门模型的安全整数推论，显式保留转换开销，避免把不同模型的精确常数混用。</p>\n<p>转换论证：任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\ge1\">\\(r\\ge1\\)</span> 输入、总顶点数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的本地电路，可删去无用门和一扇入 AND/OR，将零扇入门替换为共享常量。用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg x_1\">\\(\\neg x_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1\\land\\neg x_1\">\\(x_1\\land\\neg x_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1\\lor\\neg x_1\">\\(x_1\\lor\\neg x_1\\)</span> 三个门提供两个常量。再将输出与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{j=1}^r(x_j\\lor\\neg x_j)\">\\(\\bigwedge_{j=1}^r(x_j\\lor\\neg x_j)\\)</span> 相与，使所有输入顶点均通向唯一输出；至多增加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3r\">\\(3r\\)</span> 个门。得到原书电路至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K+3r+3\">\\(K+3r+3\\)</span> 顶点。原书电路是本地电路的子类，所以原书输入函数硬度不少于本地硬度。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r=nk\">\\(r=nk\\)</span> 应用原书定理，再将输出测试电路按上述开销转换，得到所列带减项下界；右端为零时由硬度非负性成立。</p>\n<p>来源证据边界：已逐项核对 Theorem 19.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta,\\epsilon,k\">\\(\\delta,\\epsilon,k\\)</span>、严格条件、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"400n\">\\(400n\\)</span> 分母以及 XOR 构造，并阅读印刷376–379页的硬核引理和证明。原书对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的细节交给 Exercise 19.4；本次没有独立完成该练习或重新证明一般硬核引理，故 source_proof_reviewed 保持 false。本地模型转换及取整推论已在本注内逐项复核；外部定理的完整证明不冒充本地证明。</p>\n<p>R6证据边界：一般k的硬核引理与习题19.4证明仍未完成；本地模型换算不消除该限制。本条可作为有明确来源限制的陈述记录，当前不作为已完成证明核验的依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-circuit-hardness","status":"resolved","id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-circuit-hardness","status":"resolved","id":"4265af5de6457d74","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\epsilon>2(1-\\delta)^k$；硬度和电路模型见 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in(0,1/2]","display":false},{"tex":"x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon>2(1-\\delta)^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}^{nk}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\bmod 2","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\oplus k}:\\{0,1\\}^{nk}\\to\\{0,1\\},\\qquad f^{\\oplus k}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\coloneqq\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^k f(x_i)\\right)\\bmod 2.","display":true},{"tex":"H^{1/2+\\epsilon}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f^{\\oplus k})\\ge\\max\\left\\{0,\\left\\lfloor\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{400n}H^{1-\\delta}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)\\right\\rfloor-3nk-3\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\epsilon^2 H^{1-\\delta}_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f)/(400n)","display":false},{"tex":"r\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg x_1","display":false},{"tex":"x_1\\land\\neg x_1","display":false},{"tex":"x_1\\lor\\neg x_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{j=1}^r(x_j\\lor\\neg x_j)","display":false},{"tex":"3r","display":false},{"tex":"K+3r+3","display":false},{"tex":"r=nk","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta,\\epsilon,k","display":false},{"tex":"400n","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false}],"bytes":2880,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第19章：硬度放大与纠错码：[[28-df-circuit-hardness]]、[[28-thm-yao-xor-lemma]]、[[28-df-error-correcting-code]]、[[28-prop-unique-decoding-radius]]、[[28-df-walsh-hadamard-code]]、[[28-thm-walsh-hadamard-self-correction]]、[[28-df-reed-solomon-code]]、[[28-lem-reed-solomon-distance]]、[[28-prop-concatenated-code-distance]]、[[28-thm-binary-johnson-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["4265af5de6457d74"]}